<title>NETHERLANDS: WOLTERS KLUWER DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS KLUWER DETAILS 1996 STOCK DIVIDEND.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Wednesday it had set its 1996 optional final stock dividend at one new share per 98 held.</p>
<p>In March, Wolters Kluwer announced it would pay a 1996 cash dividend of 2.48 guilders. The payment could be taken up in cash or an optional dividend in new shares.</p>
<p>Wolters Kluwer shares were trading at 231.80 guilders on the Amsterdam Stock Exchange on Wednesday morning, up 1.30 from their previous close.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 (fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
